    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d700-a1">

                <pb facs="0741" n="691" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg691"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 182—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Terrell to Mr.
                            McDowell.</hi></head>
                <p>The vali admits the guilt of Abdulaziz Aha and of Mustafa Effendi has been
                    established. If they are not punished in ten days telegraph me. Be prudent, and
                    still have faith in the justice of the grand vizier.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Terrell</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
